  "title": "Ibm Security Advisories - 2026-07-23",
  "description": "Merged 9 ibm security advisories published on 2026-07-23. Original advisory IDs: IBM-7280918, IBM-7280896, IBM-7280916, IBM-7280967, IBM-7280949, IBM-7280950, IBM-7281062, IBM-7280907, IBM-7280519\n\nTitles:\n- Multiple vulnerabilities found in CICS Transaction Gateway Desktop Edition.\n- IBM App Connect Enterprise is vulnerable to multiple vulnerabilities due to multiple Node.js modules\n- Investigation Assistant App for IBM QRadar SIEM is vulnerable to using components with known vulnerabilities\n- A vulnerability has been identified in IBM WebSphere Application Server used by IBM Rational ClearQuest (CVE-2026-9311, CVE-2026-9330)\n- The Network Threat Analytics App for IBM QRadar SIEM is vulnerable to using components with known vulnerabilities\n- IBM QRadar SIEM is vulnerable to using components with known vulnerabilities\n- IBM SPSS Analytic Server is affected by multiple vulnerabilities in IBM WebSphere Application Server Liberty\n- Security Vulnerability in Spring-Security affects IBM Sterling B2B Integrator and IBM Sterling File Gateway (CVE-2026-22732)\n- Due to the use of WebSphere Application Server Liberty, IBM Tivoli Application Dependency Discovery Manager is affected by multiple vulnerabilities",
